00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,742
We don't delete sold-out products.

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:04,842
We keep the page working for buyers.

3
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:06,633
Most stores do this.

4
00:00:07,050 --> 00:00:07,850
Hide it.

5
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:08,850
Delete it.

6
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:09,850
Forget it.

7
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:11,959
But first, ask three things.

8
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:13,937
Is it coming back?

9
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:16,934
Is there a replacement?

10
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:19,995
Does it have links?

11
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:25,017
Without those answers, a sold-out product becomes a dead page.

12
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:27,055
Sold out is only a stock problem.

13
00:00:27,150 --> 00:00:28,695
Don't make it an SEO problem.

14
